Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, ffmpeg, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), tzdata, util-linux
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/samuelvisser/vodloft
Description: Downloads and keeps a library of videos, shows and podcasts
 VODLoft follows creators and shows on The Daily Wire, YouTube and the many
 other sites yt-dlp supports, downloads what they publish, and serves it to
 Plex, Jellyfin, podcast apps and IPTV players.
 .
 It runs as the vodloft service and is reached in a browser on port 5274.
